_skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/04/20/50494840/134e957eb2acbfdd01023bfd24a67184_4067980850050893361.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用武器技后提高自身雷伤，召唤的蝴蝶攻击造成伤害后进一步提高自身雷伤；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">雷伤输出向环刃武器，蝴蝶攻击倍率可观，雷伤增益效果持续时间较长且易保持；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">戒律 · 深罪之槛使用时，【预见者的降罪】状态下可额外提高雷伤。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/04/20/50494840/134e957eb2acbfdd01023bfd24a67184_4067980850050893361.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
